(ここでいうhimというのがその作者)","ts":"1631639181.480900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qsrb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc3d6e43-add3-476e-b1e7-d210b9f77cfe","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"どのワインを飲むのが良いか\n\n\u0026gt; At one point ask him for his top tip about buying wine, thinking I'll get a few good bottle recommendations for you (he is drinking a lot of Blanc de Blanc sparkling wine at the moment, and Barbera or Barbaresco in the winter, but it's much cheaper there, where it's made) but I don't. Instead, he pauses for a long time to give me an answer about smelling wine instead. Try to find which is your stronger nostril, if you have one, and then really focus on the smell coming from the wine. And that's it: that's his tip. \"When you do this, you finally really smell the wine,\" he says. \"And this rings people to really understand which one they really like.\"\n\n\n\u003chttps://www.eurogamer.net/articles/2021-03-29-courage-and-stupidity-the-real-life-story-behind-winemaking-game-hundred-days\u003e","ts":"1631639163.480300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f0914b9-1c74-440d-b530-6e5425885a61","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみに例のHundred Days - Winemaking simulatorの作者の人のインタビューが面白かったです","ts":"1631639106.479800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E7l2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2fb01cd-6dec-44dc-884c-8641d9f83cb9","type":"message","user":"UAUFDS92N","text":"なるほど...\n少しずつ飲んでみます！","ts":"1631638280.479400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jJq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4FF7B6F5-48D5-41E1-B41E-BADA2D7B7C3E","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"バリエーションが一期一会くらい無限にあるので、奥が深いかもしれないけど、自分が気に入ったものを気軽に飲んで行くとよさそうです。そこから探究心で楽しんでもいけます。2本目も気軽にぜひ！","ts":"1631637281.479300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uoxH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f03f2156-50db-40e9-9423-e68487d25811","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"僕はもともとチーズ方面はそこそこ詳しくてワイン方面はからきしで、guyonさんのもと学び始めたという流れです","ts":"1631637024.475000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/M4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b0917fc-b609-4081-acd3-b206da9c9b00","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"野性味気になる","ts":"1631637004.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t5CQ3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45d196a7-2e85-49f0-be41-a23ed9983d86","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"余談ながらこの \u003c#CCLJFJ58F|hobby-gourmet\u003e は当初ワインとチーズについて語るチャンネルでした。(といいつつペヤングの話題も大歓迎です)","ts":"1631636975.474000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CF8y="}]},{"client_msg_id":"76aff8c0-cd32-44d5-922f-a18d6b84c3e6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおーなるほど...! \u0026gt; グルナッシュ","ts":"1631636953.473000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FOxTT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b2c3427-e6ce-417b-aa74-25cc151a7d62","type":"message","user":"UAUFDS92N","text":"ワインって奥が深いんですね...","ts":"1631636844.471700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HhCQQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82473D74-1551-4E8C-AC23-874291625113","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"南仏といえば、グルナッシュですね。私がワインにハマるきっかけになったやつです。ブレンドのベースにもよく使われピンキリなので、いい生産者という要素が加わってくると激うまなんです。野性味あるジャミーな感じ。ハズレもあって同じジャミー系統とみせかけつつ幼児向け甘い飲み薬っぽい感じになってしまう生産者もいます。","ts":"1631636471.470800","edited":{"user":"U